    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioners appearing through video conferencing stated that benefit of anticipatory bail has already been granted to co-accused Anil Mittal by the co-ordinate bench of this Court; allegation against the petitioners are similar to that of the co-accused, therefore, benefit of anticipatory bail may be granted to the accused-petitioners.",
